# Rain under the 2016 supermoon (full: the moonlit look whole), told for an hour; a touch in it; the picture changing
# to a scene and back (the weather goes and comes with the cat's picture); then a waxing quarter (lit ~0.5: half
# moonlit). See weather-drizzle.script.
creature cat packages/cat/cat.json
package packages/astrology/astrology.json
start 466 20261122 0
time 1479131520
weather 2 3600
frames 900 33333
touch 1 300 400
frames 2 33333
touch 0 0 0
frames 60 33333
scene globe 20 {"img":"moon","lit":0.82,"side":1,"r":0.6,"spin":0}
frames 90 33333
scene_clear
frames 120 33333
time 1713208380
frames 90 33333
